> > > > > > >
> > > > > > > You can infer cloud cover by comparing measured solar radiation and estimated clear sky solar radiation. There is a very good tutorial here: https://mrke.github.io/NicheMapR/inst/doc/microclimate-hourly-input-example
> > > > > > >
> > > > > > > But if you don't have measured solar radiation I am not sure of how you could do it.
> > > > > > >
> > > > > > > I hope someone else has a better answer.
> > > > > > >
> > > > > > > All the best,
> > > > > > > Urtzi
